    "guide_steps": [
      {
        "text": "**Plant Doctor.** Choose the **plant health** model in the Images tab, then make six plant images with **New image**, setting each plant's features. Play the **Home** scene to try the app.",
        "showContinue": true
      }
    ],
    "long_instructions": "# Plant Doctor\nThis project starts with a four-scene app: Home, Camera Roll, Plant Detail and About.\n\n1. In the Images tab, choose the **plant health** model.\n2. Make six plant images with **New image**. Set each plant's features; the picture is drawn from them.\n3. Play **Home**. Click **Camera Roll**, click a plant, then click **Help Me!**.",
